Read a recording back: what it counted, what each phase took, and what moved between two of them

Usage: rust-mutants trace [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  summary  What a recording counted, what every phase took, and which commands were the slowest
  check    Say whether a recording is complete: it begins, it ends, it lost nothing, and every phase
           it opened it closed
  diff     What moved between two recordings
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Whether to paint the output. `auto` paints a terminal that has not set `NO_COLOR`

          Possible values:
          - auto:   Colour a terminal that has not asked to go without
          - always: Always
          - never:  Never
          
          [default: auto]

      --cargo <PATH>
          Run this cargo, by path, rather than the one found on the `PATH`; its rustc is the one
          beside it

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
